      "sc:author": {
        "@id": "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3629-7788"
      },
      "sc:description": "Free macOS application for TaqMan endpoint SNP genotyping. Calls genotypes from two-channel allelic discrimination data with five independent algorithms (ALCHEMY, BCGA, fitPoly, polar thresholds, robust Student-t mixture) and a configurable consensus, with spectral compensation, QC metrics, Hardy-Weinberg and case/control association statistics, multi-plate cohorts, and publication-ready exports including R and Python reproducibility scripts. Reads RDML and tab-delimited endpoint exports. Runs fully offline",
